From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: misc-de <misc-de@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 14:30:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] quick settings: The tile's name instead of On and Off

Plinius: a tile shows whether it is on in the accent color already, a
label "On", "Off", "Location Off" or "NFC On" said it a second time and
hid what the tile is. The tiles say their name: Bluetooth (while no
device is connected), Auto Rotate (sensor mode), Sound (the full
feedback profile; Quiet and Silent stay), Location, Mobile Data,
Hotspot, Night Light, Caffeine and NFC. Labels that say more than on or
off stay: the Wi-Fi network, the connected Bluetooth device, Portrait
or Landscape without the sensor, the torch's brightness.

Bluetooth's "One device" and "%d devices" were not marked for
translation; they are now, the latter with plural forms. Translations
for de, es, fr, it, nl, pl, pt, pt_BR and ru.
